{
    "test_name": "MOB.349_Work_Record_Cycling",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.349_Work_Record_Cycling",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.349` The **< > cycle arrows on the work order title** \u2014 `MOB.570` proves the same\ncomponent on Asset Verification assets; this instance was unlisted until 2026-08-18.\n- \u26a0\ufe0f **Must reach the detail from the LIST, never by deep link.** `WorkDetails` passes\n  `location.state?.stageIds ?? []`, so a deep-linked page cycles an EMPTY array and\n  navigates to `/work/` with the id replaced by an empty string \u2014 the arrows are actively\n  broken there, not merely inert. This walks the `MOB.344` user path.\n- **Proof is `location.pathname`**, stashed in `sessionStorage` from a JS step because\n  Datadog cannot carry an extracted value into a later assertion \u2014 the same\n  assert-the-source-of-truth shape as `MOB.810`.\n- **SELF-RESTORING**: leg 2 cycles back and asserts the original route, with\n  `alwaysExecute` so a failed leg 1 cannot strand the session on another work order.\n- **Needs \u22652 work orders** in the crew's list \u2014 with one, forward wraps to itself and the\n  URL never changes. Guarded up front, so that failure names itself as fixture, not code.\n  (Impossible before work orders were assigned on 2026-08-20.)\n- Icon names measured, not guessed (trap 14): `circle-arrow-left` / `circle-arrow-right`.\n- \u26a0\ufe0f **Two cyclers on this page share those icons** \u2014 `RecordCycleButtons` (work orders)\n  and `InfiniteTabs`' `CycleButtons` (tabs). An unscoped locator matches both and fails\n  with *Multiple elements found* (trap 3). The record cycler is scoped by what it wraps:\n  the title, which carries the MapLink globe.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Work Orders",
            "read-only"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "headers": {},
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
            },
            "variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "set_cookie": ""
        },
        "options": {
            "device_ids": [
                "chrome.tablet"
            ],
            "disable_cors": false,
            "disable_csp": false,
            "ignore_server_certificate_error": false,
            "min_failure_duration": 0,
            "min_location_failed": 1,
            "monitor_options": {},
            "no_screenshot": false,
            "retry": {
                "count": 1,
                "interval": 300.0
            },
            "rum_settings": {
                "is_enabled": false
            },
            "tick_every": 86400
        },
        "steps": [
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Navigate to the work order list",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/work"
                },
                "type": "goToUrl"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Let the work list begin rendering",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": 3
                },
                "type": "wait"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "The \"Work Orders\" page mounted",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "check": "contains",
                    "value": "Work Orders",
                    "element": {
                        "url": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/work",
                        "userLocator": {
                            "failTestOnCannotLocate": true,
                            "values": [
                                {
                                    "type": "xpath",
                                    "value": "//*[@id=\"page-title\"]//h4[contains(normalize-space(.), \"Work Orders\")]"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "type": "assertElementContent",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
